    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "More than a hundred years ago, some "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "ancient",
            "ref": "v-ancient"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "slate",
            "zh": "石板"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "carvings",
            "ref": "v-carving"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " were found in Spain. These carvings "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " like owls. They "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from about 6,500 to 5,500 years ago."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the past, people thought these carvings had been used for "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "rituals",
            "ref": "v-ritual"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But recently, some scientists said that they had "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " been toys."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In their study, the scientists looked online for children’s drawings of owls. They "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the carvings with those drawings. The scientists found many "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "similarities",
            "ref": "v-similarity"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " between them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", many of these slates have two holes at the top. According to the scientists, "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " could be put into the holes. This could make these toys look more like owls."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "About 5,000 years ago, stone toys became less "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Ancient people began using other "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", such as wood, to make toys. Most of these toys slowly "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "over time",
            "ref": "v-over-time"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "For this "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", the owl toys are very important. “They help us learn more about the children of ancient Europe,” said one of the scientists."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
